# Copy to .env.local and adjust. All variables are optional.

# Overpass endpoints, comma-separated, in priority order. The first one is the "primary"
# (only it gets the 18s backoff + retry on 429 and the 3s retry on 500/502/504); the others
# are tried sequentially as failover. Entries are trimmed; invalid URLs are dropped with a log
# line. Unset or empty -> the defaults below.
# Failover test: put an invalid endpoint first, e.g.
#   OVERPASS_ENDPOINTS=https://invalid.example/api/interpreter,https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter,https://overpass.kumi.systems/api/interpreter,https://overpass.private.coffee/api/interpreter
OVERPASS_ENDPOINTS=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter,https://overpass.kumi.systems/api/interpreter,https://overpass.private.coffee/api/interpreter

# Postpass (Geofabrik's public PostGIS OSM database): primary source, the Overpass endpoints
# above are the fallback. One attempt per request, no retry; after a Postpass failure Overpass
# goes first for 10 minutes. Unset -> https://postpass.geofabrik.de/api/interpreter. Set to an
# empty value to switch Postpass off (Overpass only):
#   POSTPASS_ENDPOINT=
